OL,3,GNEWSACulture House opens with library
OL,4,Aand arts space
OL,5,
OL,6,FA culture hub replacing a city's
OL,7,Flibrary and gallery spaces is to open
OL,8,Flater, months after it was supposed to
OL,9,Fand millions of pounds over budget.
OL,11,FCulture House Sunderland, near Keel
OL,12,FSquare in the city centre, is a
OL,13,Fmulti-purpose venue featuring a
OL,14,Flibrary, exhibition and events spaces,
OL,15,Fbar and podcast studio.
OL,17,FDirector Leanne Littlewood said
OL,18,F"there's something for absolutely
OL,19,Feverybody across all of our spaces".
